{"type":"message","id":"73b62a45","parentId":"865dc8a2","timestamp":"2026-04-01T09:54:59.093Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to understand the current Feishu channel configuration and then propose a new one. Currently there's one feishu channel with domain \"feishu\". The user wants to add another Feishu channel called \"product_wukong\" with:\n- appId: cli_a9465bdd8efbdbef\n- appSecret: nbxsPaDbSQMbsu0MTdIJ2c4kBVc3vPI3\n- Bound to agent \"product\"\n\nLooking at the current structure, it seems like the channels.feishu is a single object. I need to understand if OpenClaw supports multiple Feishu channel configurations. Let me propose the modification based on what I see.\n\nActually, I think the user wants to add a second feishu app/workspace. The current config has one Feishu channel. I need to check if OpenClaw supports an array of feishu channels or if it uses a different key format.\n\n\nBased on the single \"feishu\" key, I suspect OpenClaw might support multiple instances using unique domain identifiers. I'll propose adding \"product_wukong\" as a second Feishu channel configuration with the provided credentials and agent binding.","thinkingSignature":"77f9bd77315960803bd1bb8c314240e820fa25d293a53781f2c177885fa198e3"},{"type":"text","text":"确认一下修改方案，核心变化是在 `channels` 下新增一个飞书实例：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"channels\": {\n    \"feishu\": {\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"appId\": \"cli_a9465e367db81bda\",\n      \"appSecret\": \"lo2VNNMbWcVDVBWT9Ee4DNHXKfe5t78J\",\n      \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n      \"domain\": \"feishu\",\n      \"groupPolicy\": \"open\"\n    },\n    \"product_wukong\": {\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"appId\": \"cli_a9465bdd8efbdbef\",\n      \"appSecret\": \"nbxsPaDbSQMbsu0MTdIJ2c4kBVc3vPI3\",\n      \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n      \"domain\": \"product_wukong\",\n      \"groupPolicy\": \"open\",\n      \"agentId\": \"product\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**改动说明：**\n- 新增 `channe