{"type":"message","id":"122537a5","parentId":"87563d8a","timestamp":"2026-04-01T09:56:46.601Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether the feishu channel configuration needs an extra level of nesting, and they've shared what seems to be an online tutorial. Let me check the skill for feishu-doc to understand the correct configuration format.","thinkingSignature":"be75d9eba7b7efe615a5d5f95db9598caed67af8e77acf4431f0c49b2b2fa5b6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ky2n0l2u4im0_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/extensions/feishu/skills/feishu-doc/SKILL.md","limit":50}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":44,"output":108,"cacheRead":44424,"cacheWrite":1061,"totalTokens":45637,"cost":{"input":0.000013199999999999999,"output":0.0001296,"cacheRead":0.00266544,"cacheWrite":0.000397875,"total":0.003206115}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775037397208,"responseId":"061c1ed53b8d4e4c389a24da44f21393"}}
{"type":"message","id":"7acab27a","parentId":"122537a5","timestamp":"2026-04-01T09:56:46.618Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ky2n0l2u4im0_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: feishu-doc\ndescription: |\n  Feishu document read/write operations. Activate when user mentions Feishu docs, cloud docs, or docx links.\n---\n\n# Feishu Document Tool\n\nSingle tool `feishu_doc` with action parameter for all document operations, including table creation for Docx.\n\n## Token Extraction\n\nFrom URL `https://xxx.feishu.cn/docx/ABC123def` → `doc_token` = `ABC123def`\n\n## Actions\n\n### Read Document\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"read\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\" }\n```\n\nReturns: title, plain text content, block statistics. Check `hint` field - if present, structured content (tables, images) exists that requires `list_blocks`.\n\n### Write Document (Replace All)\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"write\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"content\": \"# Title\\n\\nMarkdown content...\" }\n```\n\nReplaces entire document with markdown content. Supports: headings, lists, code blocks, quotes, links, images (`![](url)` auto-uploaded), bold/italic/strikethrough.\n\n**Limitation:** Markdown tables are NOT supported.\n\n### Append Content\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"append\", \"doc_token\": \"ABC123def\", \"content\": \"Additional content\" }\n```\n\nAppends markdown to end of document.\n\n### Create Document\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"create\", \"title\": \"New Document\", \"owner_open_id\": \"ou_xxx\" }\n```\n\nWith folder:\n\n\n[162 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1775037406614}}
{"type":"message","id":"f1c78099","parentId":"7acab27a","timestamp":"2026-04-01T09:56:54.804Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"That's about feishu-doc, not about channel configuration. Let me look at the actual config structure from the current file. The user's online tutorial might be suggesting a different nesting level. Let me also check the feishu extension's configuration documentation or the existing config to understand better.\n\nLooking at the current config:\n```json\n\"channels\": {\n  \"feishu\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"appId\": \"cli_a9465e367db81bda\",\n    \"appSecret\": \"lo2VNNMbWcVDVBWT9Ee4DNHXKfe5t78J\",\n    \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n    \"domain\": \"feishu\",\n    \"groupPolicy\": \"open\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe user says the tutorial might suggest a different nesting. I'm not sure what the tutorial says exactly, but I should ask to see the tutorial or check if there's a pattern like `channels.feishu.instance_name` or similar.\n\nActually, I don't have the tutorial content - the user just mentioned it exists but didn't paste it. Let me ask them to share it.","thinkingSignature":"cacaefb542ff1f6106c05e3f6a6659e6ac16a532e61819d3a124b20c384bd1fa"},{"type":"text","text":"麻烦把教程内容发出来我看看？当前配置文件里 `channels.feishu` 下面直接就是 `appId`、`appSecret` 这些字段。如果你看到的教程结构不一样，发来我可以对比确认哪个是正确的。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":33361,"output":281,"cacheRead":12630,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46272,"cost":{"input":0.0100083,"output":0.0003372,"cacheRead":0.0007577999999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011103299999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775037406619,"responseId":"061c1ede2cdd87e88c56b895b4fe04a2"}}
